# A Goldstruck Gigas (abyssea 163): a level 99 Warrior in La Theine Plateau by the Cavernous Maw with The Truth Beckons
# completed and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, no maw quest completed and To Paste a Peiste accepted
# (GMs; an accepted one does not count). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 218 (entranceMawOnTrigger),
# finished on option 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 1 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 9 (a Progress), finished on option 0:
# begun. Back to available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 9 again (an Event-rank 9 would alternate
# with the maw's own onTrigger: 218), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the maw: no handler: 218. A
# zone-in, accepted with no Briareus title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 10 (left open); its update on
# option 0 and on option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 0 completed: Lunar Abyssite II);
# finished: Lunar Abyssite II given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and Dawn of Death still held): a zone-in:
# nothing; the maw: 218.
lists LaTheinePlateau/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/9 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/218 LaTheinePlateau/onZoneIn/1 LaTheinePlateau/onEventUpdate/10 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/10
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-556.4,0.001,637.846 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste accepted
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 218
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone1                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 9
finish                                  # option 0: begun
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas available # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 9 again (the kind)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # accepted: no maw handler: 218
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
rezone                                  # accepted, no title: nothing
title BriareusFeller                    # a GM
rezone open                             # the title: 10, left open
update 10 option=0                      # option 0: nothing
update 10 option=2                      # option 2: nothing
update 10 option=1                      # option 1: updateEvent(Lunar Abyssite II)
finish                                  # Lunar Abyssite II given; completed
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # completed: no section: 218
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
